WEBVTT

00:04.720 --> 00:08.390
<b>How does this look for the layout
of the Foundation Festival stall?</b>

00:08.390 --> 00:12.850
<b>It might be better if it had a wider space
to lay out the merchandise.</b>

00:12.850 --> 00:14.520
<b>All right. Erase this part please.</b>

00:14.520 --> 00:16.650
<b>Got it. Please.</b>

00:21.200 --> 00:23.280
<b>Oh! Looks good!</b>

00:23.280 --> 00:26.910
<b>We should decorate it, too,
since it's a festival and all.</b>

00:26.910 --> 00:30.750
<b>--Preparations for the Foundation
Festival are going smoothly.
--We'll take care of that later. First we lock in the basic shape.</b>

00:30.750 --> 00:31.370
<b>--Preparations for the Foundation
Festival are going smoothly.
--Have we decided what exactly to sell?</b>

00:31.370 --> 00:32.620
<b>--Yes. I'm glad all the employees
are so positive about it.
--Have we decided what exactly to sell?</b>

00:32.620 --> 00:34.920
<b>--Yes. I'm glad all the employees
are so positive about it.
--Let's talk to Miss Selma about it tomorrow.</b>

00:34.920 --> 00:35.420
<b>--Yes. I'm glad all the employees
are so positive about it.
--We should decide soon.</b>

00:35.420 --> 00:36.420
<b>--I think I can count on them.
--We should decide soon.</b>

00:36.420 --> 00:38.000
<b>--I think I can count on them.
--Can't wait!</b>

00:43.680 --> 00:47.430
<b>The Semroid Troupe are
beginning rehearsals, too.</b>

00:47.430 --> 00:51.770
<b>Are they using magic to make their
swords shine? That's a cool visual effect.</b>

00:51.770 --> 00:54.350
<b>Hey, Ryoma.</b>

00:54.350 --> 00:56.060
<b>Heading home?</b>

00:56.060 --> 00:58.940
<b>Good evening, Mr. Worgan.</b>

00:58.940 --> 01:00.480
<b>You got a moment?</b>

01:00.480 --> 01:01.860
<b>Yes.</b>

01:01.860 --> 01:05.280
<b>Thanks for taking up that tunnel ant job.</b>

01:05.280 --> 01:10.040
<b>I thought for a while that you were
planning on being a full-time merchant.</b>

01:10.040 --> 01:13.370
<b>I also heard you were trying
to raise your adventurer rank.</b>

01:13.370 --> 01:18.630
<b>Yes, I'm going to have to
take my time with it, but I'd like to.</b>

01:18.630 --> 01:23.090
<b>Well, now that you're an employer,
you have work and duties.</b>

01:23.090 --> 01:27.050
<b>You can't be a full-time
adventurer. I get it.</b>

01:27.050 --> 01:31.100
<b>Anyway, on to the main topic. Can you make
yourself available over the next few days?</b>

01:31.100 --> 01:32.430
<b>Yes, I can.</b>

01:32.430 --> 01:36.440
<b>Good. There's a certain job
I'd like your help with.</b>

01:36.440 --> 01:39.270
<b>The specific task is gathering materials,</b>

01:39.270 --> 01:43.650
<b>but we need a space magic user
because the amount of materials is huge.</b>

01:43.650 --> 01:47.280
<b>Also, you'll be able to hunt
a monster you wanted to take on.</b>

01:47.280 --> 01:48.570
<b>Really?!</b>

01:48.570 --> 01:52.870
<b>Yeah. The job calls for
gathering treant material.</b>

01:54.000 --> 01:59.460
<b>Treants! It'll be good practice for
my trip to the Great Forest of Schluss!</b>

01:59.460 --> 02:01.630
<b>Yes, please!</b>

03:31.970 --> 03:36.970
<b>"Episode 10"
"Ryoma and the Flying Slime"</b>

03:39.480 --> 03:42.600
<b>Those are the details of the job.</b>

03:42.600 --> 03:47.900
<b>Good, every member of the party
Mr. Worgan assembled is reliable.</b>

03:47.900 --> 03:52.610
<b>Hmm. I understand that
treant wood is needed,</b>

03:52.610 --> 03:54.870
<b>but 300 treants minimum?</b>

03:54.870 --> 03:56.990
<b>That's a lot.</b>

03:56.990 --> 03:59.580
<b>What are you going to do with all of that?</b>

03:59.580 --> 04:02.290
<b>In a nutshell, it's a town renewal project.</b>

04:02.290 --> 04:04.000
<b>Town renewal?</b>

04:04.000 --> 04:08.210
<b>As you know, this town, Gimul,
is a mining town.</b>

04:08.210 --> 04:10.970
<b>But what if we run out of ore to mine?</b>

04:10.970 --> 04:14.390
<b>We'd run out of work,
and people would move out.</b>

04:14.390 --> 04:19.470
<b>To prevent that from happening,
we want to build a new tourist attraction.</b>

04:19.470 --> 04:25.060
<b>Specifically, we want to build a new town
for tourists outside the south gate,</b>

04:25.060 --> 04:28.070
<b>and place a fighting arena at its center.</b>

04:28.070 --> 04:30.780
<b>A fighting arena! Sounds fun!</b>

04:30.780 --> 04:37.280
<b>Inns for the competitors and the audience,
food and drink, and gambling, too, right?</b>

04:37.280 --> 04:39.370
<b>Sounds like a lot of potential profit.</b>

04:39.370 --> 04:45.000
<b>But why treant wood?
Why not just normal wood?</b>

04:45.000 --> 04:49.380
<b>Apparently, we hired a famous
architect to design the arena.</b>

04:49.380 --> 04:56.300
<b>But the architect is a famous weirdo,
and wants treant wood all over the arena.</b>

04:56.300 --> 04:58.970
<b>Yes, that is strange indeed.</b>

04:58.970 --> 05:02.230
<b>Treant wood isn't bad
as a building material,</b>

05:02.230 --> 05:05.900
<b>but it's normally used to
make wands for magicians.</b>

05:05.900 --> 05:10.230
<b>Yeah, so this is a weird one,
but the pay is solid.</b>

05:10.230 --> 05:12.650
<b>Asagi, you take the lead.
I'm counting on you.</b>

05:12.650 --> 05:14.240
<b>Very well.</b>

05:14.240 --> 05:18.280
<b>Also, I brought in Ryoma
as a space magic user,</b>

05:18.280 --> 05:21.620
<b>but he wants experience fighting treants.</b>

05:21.620 --> 05:23.120
<b>Thank you.</b>

05:23.120 --> 05:26.920
<b>Everyone will more than
eagerly help Ryoma in any way!</b>

05:26.920 --> 05:29.630
<b>Yes! Of course!</b>

05:29.630 --> 05:35.380
<b>Good. Get ready by tomorrow morning
and head out to the location.</b>

05:42.350 --> 05:44.390
<b>The last time I fought in a party</b>

05:44.390 --> 05:47.730
<b>was at the abandoned mines,
when we fought those goblins.</b>

05:53.150 --> 05:56.360
<b>It's been a while. This is exciting.</b>

05:56.360 --> 06:00.080
<b>We'll reach the target
forest by nightfall.</b>

06:00.080 --> 06:05.580
<b>We'll set up camp there for the night,
and start the hunt tomorrow morning.</b>

06:05.580 --> 06:10.420
<b>I'll update you on the things you should
watch out for when fighting treants.</b>

06:10.420 --> 06:11.250
<b>Yes.</b>

06:11.250 --> 06:14.340
<b>Treants move their branches
around to attack,</b>

06:14.340 --> 06:18.050
<b>so you should pay attention to attacks
coming from above especially.</b>

06:18.050 --> 06:22.390
<b>Their weakness is the human
face-like lump on the trunk.</b>

06:22.390 --> 06:27.890
<b>Damage the lump itself, or cut off
the area below the lump to finish it off.</b>

06:27.890 --> 06:33.360
<b>The face-like lump, is that the way to
differentiate regular trees from treants?</b>

06:33.360 --> 06:37.610
<b>If so, what if the lump
was on the other side?</b>

06:37.610 --> 06:40.740
<b>Treants are monsters, too,
so they possess magic power.</b>

06:40.740 --> 06:43.950
<b>Detect that to easily identify them.</b>

06:43.950 --> 06:47.290
<b>I see, then there's no issue.</b>

06:47.290 --> 06:50.500
<b>I have to keep my magic
detection up at all times.</b>

06:57.720 --> 07:00.430
<b>Yes! I did it!</b>

07:05.020 --> 07:07.430
<b>Ryoma, what's that?</b>

07:07.430 --> 07:08.770
<b>This is...</b>

07:10.400 --> 07:11.480
<b>A chair.</b>

07:11.480 --> 07:13.230
<b>Wow!</b>

07:14.650 --> 07:16.070
<b>Here's a table, too.</b>

07:16.070 --> 07:18.400
<b>Wh-What?!</b>

07:19.820 --> 07:23.530
<b>This table and these chairs
are truly impressive.</b>

07:23.530 --> 07:27.040
<b>It's a great way to save space.</b>

07:27.040 --> 07:33.250
<b>When I used to live alone, I wanted to
make traveling as comfortable as possible.</b>

07:33.250 --> 07:37.670
<b>Impressive as always, Ryoma!
Ryoma is a genius!</b>

07:38.970 --> 07:43.800
<b>I just replicated the camping goods
that I wanted back in the other world,</b>

07:43.800 --> 07:46.100
<b>but I'm glad they like it...</b>

07:46.100 --> 07:51.440
<b>Once we get in the forest, I will work with
Miya and the other to fight the treants.</b>

07:51.440 --> 07:54.980
<b>Leipin and Ryoma will
carry the fallen treants.</b>

07:54.980 --> 07:59.490
<b>Leipin will additionally search for and
take caution against surrounding treants.</b>

07:59.490 --> 08:03.490
<b>Ryoma will guard Leipin. Understood?</b>

08:03.490 --> 08:07.700
<b>Once the situation stabilizes,
Ryoma will join us in the fight.</b>

08:07.700 --> 08:08.790
<b>Yes, please.</b>

08:08.790 --> 08:11.960
<b>Ryoma, there's no need to be so tense.</b>

08:11.960 --> 08:12.710
<b>Huh?</b>

08:12.710 --> 08:18.380
<b>On the way here, in the carriage,
you seemed very focused.</b>

08:18.380 --> 08:23.970
<b>We're here for you. Relax and
gain experience at your own pace.</b>

08:23.970 --> 08:25.600
<b>Thank you.</b>

08:25.600 --> 08:30.560
<b>No need to overthink it.
I'm sure you'll get good quickly, Ryoma!</b>

08:30.560 --> 08:35.980
<b>Ryoma should be able to learn
the characteristics of treant magic power soon.</b>

08:35.980 --> 08:39.070
<b>Worst case, we'll protect you.</b>

08:39.070 --> 08:41.740
<b>We've got your back.</b>

08:41.740 --> 08:44.610
<b>I'll take care of healing.</b>

08:44.610 --> 08:48.200
<b>Everyone... Thank you!</b>

08:49.370 --> 08:54.420
<b>It's good to have older adventurers
around to teach me.</b>

08:54.420 --> 09:00.090
<b>It's a different kind of fun compared to working
with the employees to run a good business.</b>

09:05.640 --> 09:08.430
<b>Are you ready?</b>

09:08.430 --> 09:10.430
<b>Let's go.</b>

09:16.650 --> 09:20.480
<b>Hmm, I see one already.</b>

09:20.480 --> 09:25.660
<b>Miya, do you see the slightly thick
tree ahead, about 10 meters away?</b>

09:25.660 --> 09:26.780
<b>That one?</b>

09:26.780 --> 09:27.820
<b>Yes.</b>

09:27.820 --> 09:31.200
<b>Yes, I do feel magic power from that tree.</b>

09:31.200 --> 09:35.040
<b>But visually, it looks like
any other tree.</b>

09:37.500 --> 09:38.920
<b>There!</b>

09:46.590 --> 09:48.010
<b>We got it.</b>

09:48.010 --> 09:49.970
<b>Guys, you're up!</b>

09:54.560 --> 09:56.690
<b>Dimension Home!</b>

10:01.780 --> 10:04.690
<b>One hit kill, just dodge the branches.</b>

10:04.690 --> 10:06.950
<b>Three up ahead!</b>

10:06.950 --> 10:11.830
<b>Understood. I'll take the center one,
you all handle the sides!</b>

10:22.300 --> 10:25.170
<b>Windcutter!</b>

10:31.720 --> 10:36.020
<b>I see another one over there.
No more nearby.</b>

10:36.020 --> 10:38.100
<b>Ryoma, do you want to try?</b>

10:38.100 --> 10:39.440
<b>Yes!</b>

10:51.830 --> 10:55.200
<b>Yes, I can handle one treant no problem.</b>

10:55.200 --> 10:57.330
<b>Ryoma, you're good!</b>

10:57.330 --> 11:03.550
<b>This is strange, though. Treants usually
prefer dark areas deep inside the forest.</b>

11:03.550 --> 11:08.300
<b>They shouldn't be out here
in such high numbers.</b>

11:08.300 --> 11:15.010
<b>We're off to a good start. Let's go back
to the camp and take a lunch break.</b>

11:20.770 --> 11:26.690
<b>Like Mr. Leipin said, this forest
does feel somewhat strange.</b>

11:27.360 --> 11:30.610
<b>Ryoma! Where are you?!</b>

11:35.330 --> 11:37.290
<b>Did you see that?</b>

11:41.670 --> 11:45.460
<b>Ryoma, that was a great attack earlier.</b>

11:45.460 --> 11:49.590
<b>From the afternoon,
please take on the treants we miss.</b>

11:49.590 --> 11:50.840
<b>Understood.</b>

11:50.840 --> 11:56.600
<b>But don't push yourself too hard. Keeping
Leipin and yourself safe should come first.</b>

11:56.600 --> 11:57.470
<b>Yes.</b>

11:57.470 --> 11:59.430
<b>Ryoma, you can do it!</b>

11:59.430 --> 12:03.350
<b>Mr. Ryoma, that weapon--
that's a slime, right?</b>

12:03.350 --> 12:08.740
<b>Yes, the scabbard is a metal slime,
and the blade is an iron slime, transformed.</b>

12:08.740 --> 12:14.820
<b>I see, that's how you solved the issue
of the katana being hard to acquire.</b>

12:14.820 --> 12:19.330
<b>Ryoma continues to expand
the boundaries of what a slime can do.</b>

12:19.330 --> 12:21.330
<b>Hmm? What's that?</b>

12:21.330 --> 12:22.620
<b>It's a slime.</b>

12:22.620 --> 12:24.380
<b>That's a slime?!</b>

12:24.380 --> 12:28.630
<b>It's called a fluff slime.
It has the ability to fly.</b>

12:28.630 --> 12:34.840
<b>Fluff slime... I wasn't aware of that.
Mr. Leipin, can you capture it?</b>

12:34.840 --> 12:36.850
<b>Too easy.</b>

12:36.850 --> 12:38.510
<b>Pick Up!</b>

12:40.310 --> 12:41.230
<b>What was that?</b>

12:41.230 --> 12:45.650
<b>It's a form of Space Magic that transports
the target close to the user.</b>

12:45.650 --> 12:51.400
<b>It only works on targets within visual range,
and the aim is very difficult,</b>

12:51.400 --> 12:57.370
<b>so not many people use it, but it has
the unique benefit of capturing without harm.</b>

12:57.370 --> 12:59.040
<b>I see.</b>

12:59.040 --> 13:05.000
<b>Ryoma, go ahead and tame it. You are
the specialist when it comes to slimes.</b>

13:05.000 --> 13:06.920
<b>Thank you so much!</b>

13:09.130 --> 13:11.800
<b>Contract complete.</b>

13:11.800 --> 13:13.510
<b>Identify monster!</b>

13:14.340 --> 13:19.760
<b>Skills are flight, lighten weight, and...
Multiplication level 8?!</b>

13:21.390 --> 13:22.980
<b>Lighten weight...</b>

13:22.980 --> 13:26.770
<b>What? It's almost weightless.</b>

13:26.770 --> 13:31.610
<b>Its weight isn't completely zero,
but it comes close.</b>

13:31.610 --> 13:34.360
<b>That's also the flight skill, as well.</b>

13:34.360 --> 13:40.080
<b>After we finish this job, I'll think about
what I can do with this slime.</b>

13:40.080 --> 13:45.420
<b>Ryoma looks like he's earnestly
enjoying talking about slimes.</b>

13:45.420 --> 13:49.710
<b>He appears appropriately childish for
his age, but only during that moment.</b>

13:50.880 --> 13:54.550
<b>W-We should get back to hunting now!</b>

13:56.590 --> 13:58.430
<b>Hmm? Is that...?</b>

13:58.430 --> 14:00.390
<b>Did you notice, too, Ryoma?</b>

14:00.390 --> 14:01.310
<b>Yes.</b>

14:01.310 --> 14:05.140
<b>That area just had normal trees
when we came in the morning,</b>

14:05.140 --> 14:09.400
<b>but now, more than half are treants.</b>

14:09.400 --> 14:11.570
<b>Does that happen a lot?</b>

14:11.570 --> 14:14.190
<b>It's much too fast.</b>

14:14.190 --> 14:19.070
<b>According to my experience, there could be
a dangerous evolved species nearby.</b>

14:19.070 --> 14:21.910
<b>But we can't turn back now.</b>

14:21.910 --> 14:23.950
<b>We'll keep our guard up
and continue hunting.</b>

14:23.950 --> 14:28.040
<b>Even if the cause is something we
can't handle, I'd like to investigate it.</b>

14:28.040 --> 14:31.090
<b>The individual treants
aren't that big of a threat.</b>

14:31.090 --> 14:34.340
<b>As long as we stay sharp,
we won't get hurt too seriously.</b>

14:34.340 --> 14:37.340
<b>Right, let's get to work!</b>

14:48.900 --> 14:51.770
<b>Windcutter!</b>

14:51.770 --> 14:54.030
<b>We're not in any danger, but...</b>

14:54.030 --> 14:56.280
<b>This is endless!</b>

14:58.320 --> 14:59.700
<b>Heal!</b>

15:03.580 --> 15:05.120
<b>Thank you!</b>

15:05.120 --> 15:09.790
<b>Thank you, Ryoma! We are short-staffed,
please stay on the front lines!</b>

15:09.790 --> 15:11.960
<b>Leipin, provide support!</b>

15:11.960 --> 15:13.750
<b>Understood!</b>

15:23.350 --> 15:26.350
<b>This area is clear of treants.</b>

15:26.350 --> 15:31.650
<b>But the area in front of us
is almost all treants.</b>

15:31.650 --> 15:33.610
<b>Let's go as far as we can!</b>

15:33.610 --> 15:37.240
<b>Everyone, don't push too hard!
There is no shame in retreat!</b>

15:37.240 --> 15:38.650
<b>I know!</b>

15:38.650 --> 15:41.280
<b>Safety first indeed.</b>

15:47.660 --> 15:51.670
<b>At this rate, everyone will
tire out at some point.</b>

15:53.130 --> 15:55.960
<b>Hmm? Ryoma, what are you doing?</b>

15:55.960 --> 15:58.010
<b>I'm stepping things up!</b>

15:58.010 --> 16:01.010
<b>Unshrink! Separate!</b>

16:13.770 --> 16:16.610
<b>I thought about this method a while back.</b>

16:16.610 --> 16:19.650
<b>Thrown weapons are finished
when you run out,</b>

16:19.650 --> 16:21.860
<b>but this way, I'll never run out
of ammunition,</b>

16:21.860 --> 16:24.620
<b>and I don't have to
run around to collect it!</b>

16:24.620 --> 16:26.740
<b>Ryoma, awesome!</b>

16:26.740 --> 16:30.870
<b>Let's let him handle the front!
We'll cover his back!</b>

16:50.600 --> 16:51.730
<b>I knew it.</b>

16:51.730 --> 16:55.150
<b>No, it's more powerful than I expected.</b>

16:55.150 --> 16:57.150
<b>What a huge amount of magic power...</b>

16:57.150 --> 17:01.530
<b>Elder treant.
I've seen a few of them before,</b>

17:01.530 --> 17:06.910
<b>but none that are so huge with
such a massive amount of magic power.</b>

17:06.910 --> 17:11.330
<b>If we leave it alone, it might turn
the whole forest into treants.</b>

17:11.330 --> 17:15.920
<b>Even if we can't defeat it, we need to
at least get some information about it.</b>

17:15.920 --> 17:18.790
<b>Leipin, Ryoma, how are your
magic power reserves?</b>

17:18.790 --> 17:20.250
<b>I'm fine.</b>

17:20.250 --> 17:23.470
<b>Me, too. I hardly used
any magic up to this point.</b>

17:23.470 --> 17:30.140
<b>Right. I didn't expect you to turn slimes
into axes and throw them.</b>

17:30.140 --> 17:33.770
<b>Then, let's go hunt that elder treant!</b>

17:42.190 --> 17:44.990
<b>The metal slimes are scared?</b>

17:48.410 --> 17:53.750
<b>Good call. You should not force
a scared monster to fight.</b>

17:53.750 --> 17:57.210
<b>Yes, but what was it afraid of?</b>

18:02.050 --> 18:06.930
<b>Don't panic! Treants can walk,
but their movement is slow!</b>

18:07.840 --> 18:09.430
<b>Meow?!</b>

18:11.260 --> 18:13.310
<b>It's the elder treant's roots!</b>

18:13.310 --> 18:15.100
<b>Pavement!</b>

18:21.190 --> 18:23.730
<b>This should buy some time!</b>

18:23.730 --> 18:26.490
<b>Ryoma and Leipin,
stay there and provide cover!</b>

18:26.490 --> 18:28.410
<b>Cilia, protect them!</b>

18:28.410 --> 18:31.240
<b>The rest of us will
finish off the elder treant!</b>

18:34.290 --> 18:36.960
<b>Windcutter!</b>

18:46.050 --> 18:46.880
<b>What's this?!</b>

18:46.880 --> 18:48.880
<b>Trouble!</b>

18:51.390 --> 18:53.510
<b>That's darkness magic!</b>

18:53.510 --> 18:58.060
<b>The ability to corrode metals.
What an astounding ability...</b>

18:58.060 --> 19:01.310
<b>If it destroys our weapons,
how can we attack it?!</b>

19:01.310 --> 19:04.820
<b>That's why the metal slime
was scared earlier!</b>

19:04.820 --> 19:07.240
<b>Wait, in that case...</b>

19:07.240 --> 19:11.570
<b>Unshrink! Separate!</b>

19:23.540 --> 19:28.260
<b>I knew it! It can't rust away pure iron!</b>

19:28.260 --> 19:32.600
<b>Sorry, everyone, please buy me
five seconds of time!</b>

19:33.760 --> 19:35.220
<b>Thanks!</b>

19:35.220 --> 19:37.730
<b>Everyone, provide cover for Ryoma!</b>

19:45.150 --> 19:47.570
<b>Good, it's in range!</b>

19:53.200 --> 19:55.530
<b>Ryoma, you do the finishing blow.</b>

19:55.530 --> 20:00.000
<b>Mr. Ryoma and the slimes
did the most work today.</b>

20:00.000 --> 20:02.250
<b>Go ahead and deliver a cool finish.</b>

20:02.250 --> 20:03.500
<b>Yes!</b>

20:10.880 --> 20:12.300
<b>Yes!</b>

20:12.300 --> 20:17.140
<b>Not only did you get to hunt treants,
but an elder treant, as well.</b>

20:17.140 --> 20:21.480
<b>Yes, thanks to all of you,
I was able to experience a rare battle.</b>

20:21.480 --> 20:23.440
<b>And you even allowed me
to deliver the final blow.</b>

20:23.440 --> 20:26.270
<b>Well, allowed is one way to put it,
but to be more accurate,</b>

20:26.270 --> 20:31.280
<b>I trusted that you could do it,
so I decided to provide cover.</b>

20:31.280 --> 20:34.200
<b>Trust? Me?</b>

20:34.200 --> 20:37.660
<b>I think everyone here
has the same feeling.</b>

20:41.250 --> 20:44.920
<b>I truly am surrounded by great people.</b>

20:44.920 --> 20:49.840
<b>To be trusted by people
that I trust, it's so...</b>

20:55.470 --> 20:58.970
<b>Thanks for waiting,
this is mountain vegetable tempura.</b>

21:02.180 --> 21:06.770
<b>I didn't know you could cook
mountain vegetables so deliciously!</b>

21:06.770 --> 21:11.490
<b>We took down so many treants,
so our job should be complete.</b>

21:11.490 --> 21:14.410
<b>Who would've known that
a black-market dealer of magic crystals</b>

21:14.410 --> 21:17.530
<b>was buried under that elder treant.</b>

21:17.530 --> 21:21.410
<b>Ew, don't remind me, I'm trying to eat.</b>

21:21.410 --> 21:28.130
<b>Sorry. But those magic crystals were feeding
excess magic energy to the elder treant.</b>

21:28.130 --> 21:30.840
<b>This is an important discovery.</b>

21:30.840 --> 21:33.970
<b>I never even imagined
I'd get to enjoy miso soup...</b>

21:33.970 --> 21:36.930
<b>This is undoubtedly the taste of home!</b>

21:36.930 --> 21:40.390
<b>I was able to buy soy sauce
and miso in Lenaf.</b>

21:40.390 --> 21:44.390
<b>Lenaf, right. Thank you for the great tip.</b>

21:44.390 --> 21:47.730
<b>I've never seen someone eat while crying.</b>

21:47.730 --> 21:49.980
<b>Who can resist such an emotional moment?</b>

21:49.980 --> 21:54.780
<b>I am such a lucky fellow!</b>

21:54.780 --> 22:01.290
<b>I met Mr. Pioro and got some miso,
which made Mr. Asagi so happy.</b>

22:01.290 --> 22:04.250
<b>This feels like a wonderful connection.</b>

22:04.250 --> 22:08.420
<b>I hope I can make more good connections
like these at the Founding Festival.</b>
